References:

- <https://blogs.juniper.net/en-us/threat-research/cve-2021-25646-apache-druid-embedded-javascript-remote-code-execution>
- <https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/McAoLfyf_tgFIfGTAoRCiw>

## Vulnerable Environment

